private lemma liftPair {k':ℕ} (X ℓ:Side){K:Calibration}(v:K.c X=ℓ) (S:Finset Cover)(p:Roomy S ℓ)(F:Mark ℓ)(s: Window.Family)(z:Fin k' → Cover)
    (f:AtSupport false (region S ℓ) F)(g:Continuous F)(he:∀ x y:Fields _,x.1=y.1→F x= F y)(t:∀ i,nodeC (z i)∈S)
    (u:∀ x,F x∈ Hap s ((wrap _)∘z) (region S ℓ)):
    ∃ a:Buffered.Family K, a∈ Filigree K s z S ∧ arrange (K.c X) ℓ v (a X)= F:=by
 subst ℓ; exact Filigree.shaft p F f g he t u
private lemma liftProtocol
    (cost:∀ᶠ s in atTop,∀ᶠ i in atTop, ∀ᶠ k in atTop,(Y.voyage i).kick≤k ∧ s ≤ Y.uv k ∧ (∀ b (S:Finset (Seat (Papal.count Y s i))), Sparse d S→HearthB R (sp b P.K.j (gram Y s i k).J.M (1:Pane (Papal.count Y s i))) S) ∧ ∀ (z:SU.Slot),
      let x:=grain (payout d q w); let F:=taggin Y s i k q d w x z; let ℓ:=max P.J.n (payout d q w+1)
      Cliplet.Perron P.K.j (gram Y s i k).J.M w d ℓ γ (gram Y s i k).p.threshold F ∧
      (∀ X:Fields _,‖F.frame X‖≤(1+R)^(q^4)) ∧ ‖Journey.compass Y i k s (reflMark 0 0 F.frame * F.frame)‖ ≤1/4096)
    (p:addgap (tent Y H) ≤ q) (v:Cornet Y H q d w ((1+R)^(q^4)) A) : Korn Y H q d w ((1+R)^(q^4)) A:=by
 have uB:addgap (tent Y H) ≤ payout d q w:= by
    refine p.trans ?_; unfold payout
    exact (Nat.le_add_right ..).trans' (Nat.le_mul_of_pos_left _ (by omega))
 refine ⟨v,uB,?_⟩
 let x:=grain (payout d q w)
 let S:=Sen x (payout d q w)
 filter_upwards [cost] with s cost
 filter_upwards [cost,roomyTail Y H s S] with i hK p
 let n:=Papal.count Y s i; let z':= booty x d q; let Zn:=wrap n ∘ z'; let lo:=(terrain Y H (Y.ir i) s)
 filter_upwards [hK] with k u z
 let K:= tent Y H; let W:=Window.family z; let C:= (1+R)^(q^4); let f:= taggin Y s i k q d w x z; obtain ⟨l,l1,Hh,Sx⟩:=u; obtain ⟨t,g,a⟩:= Sx z
 let F:= f.frame-1; have hc:f.broad=region S n:= sen_islet ..; let M₀:= (gram Y s i k).J.M
 have hx: VolumeX Zn⊆ f.broad:=t.enter; let Ω:=f.broad
 have ht:Continuous F:= (feastReady ..).sub continuous_const
 have he: ∀ x,F x∈ Hap W Zn Ω:= fun x0=> blossomHap (P.kJ ▸ (by decide)) hx (Hh false _ t.far).1 x0
 have hF: AtSupport false Ω F:=by unfold F; rw [sub_eq_add_neg,← neg_one_smul ℂ (1:Buffered.Mark _)]; exact t.atCost.addM ((AtSupport.oneM _).smulM _)
 have hX(x y:Fields n)(p:x.1=y.1) : F x=F y:=by unfold F; simp only [Pi.sub_apply,Pi.one_apply]; exact congrArg (· - 1) (repast_one _ _ x y p)
 obtain ⟨y,v,lz⟩:= liftPair (momentm Y i s) n lo S p F W z' (hc ▸ hF) ht hX (stake_centers Y H _ _ _ _) (fun x=> hc ▸ he x)
 exact ⟨a,y,v,lz⟩
-- extra supplier passed into govt, allow ask heights arbitrarily. IF need calibration radius issues come back
private def aggrandize (Q U : Supplier) : Supplier := fun K p X V B d T W M J l Z=> max (U K p X V B d T W M J l Z) (Q K p X V B d T W M J l Z)
private def agendup (G Z:ℝ)(d:ℕ):= max 0 ((G+Z+10002)/innerRate d)
private def heatPair (G Z:ℝ)(d:ℕ)(R:ℝ):= min 1 (Real.exp (-2*(agendup G Z d+R))/(2*R+3))
private def decree (d:ℕ)(R:ℝ): Supplier:= fun K p X V B d0 U W M J l Z=> (heatPair (sealPrice V W+ blossom K) Z d R)⁻¹
private lemma blooms (G Z:ℝ)(d:ℕ)(h:0<R):
 let e:=heatPair G Z d R; 0<e ∧ e ≤ 1 ∧ e*(2*R+3) ≤ Real.exp (-2*(agendup G Z d+R)) ∧ agendup G Z d*innerRate d ≥ G+Z+10002:=by
 unfold heatPair; have hp:=innerRate_pos d; intro V; unfold V
 refine ⟨lt_min zero_lt_one (by positivity),min_le_left ..,(le_div_iff₀ (by linarith)).mp (min_le_right ..),(div_le_iff₀ hp).mp (le_max_right ..)⟩

